                             the output level of SQW pin is controlled by
                             _d_e_v_._d_s_1_3_0_7_._%_d_._s_q_w___o_u_t.

     _d_e_v_._d_s_1_3_0_7_._%_d_._s_q_w___f_r_e_q  Select the frequency of the SQW pin when the
